From ccc6b921e7c080daa467beedf334a153f6cb13b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 08:41:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: 95 English strings translated in 25 packs, the scheduler
 grid opens at its row, the firmware overlay loses its dead buttons, DTIM 1
 explained, BQ16 Pro radio layout

- Language packs: 94 of the 113 strings that were still English in every pack
  translated (19 brand or acronym tokens kept), the About page vendor credits
  reworded, the DTIM explainer says 1 and why, RWIF_117 says the puncturing
  list is a confirmation scan, plus the new Site Survey (RSVY_1-34) and
  Connections (RCON_44-46) strings. All 25 packs stay in lockstep.
- Reaper_WiFiSettings.asp: the scheduler grid opens over the clicked row
  instead of the middle of the document (the shell frame never scrolls).
- Reaper_Firmware.asp: no button during a download from the update server, and
  the upload veil's Cancel hatch is gone; the terminal-state Close stays.
- help_content.js: the System Log dropdown hints say what each one does.
- Advanced_Wireless_Content.asp, Main_WStatus_Content.asp, Tools_Sysinfo.asp:
  the ZenWiFi BQ16 Pro takes the GT-BE98 Pro radio layout; the unreachable
  Smart Connect `return 7` fallback (slots 0-2, no 6 GHz) is removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
