-RWDN_103=Blocked packets is every packet Warden dropped - inbound, outbound and the router's own traffic, IPv4 and IPv6 - counted since the date shown under the country table. The live counters are banked to internal flash every 15 minutes and on every apply, so the number survives reboots and rule rebuilds.
