-RWDN_105=The log is a different view: one line per dropped packet, only while Warden logging is on, kept in a small rotating syslog buffer. The Firewall page's Logging tab shows the last 400 lines, mixed with the stock firewall's own entries.
-RWDN_106=Under a burst the kernel and syslog drop lines while the counter keeps every packet, so the count is always the larger figure and the reliable one.
-RWDN_107=Countries, threat feeds and manual blocks are read from the same snapshot as the total, so they add up to it. A remainder shows as Unclassified only for statistics saved by an older firmware.
